<p>Zaid e shaheed ka hai zabaa'n par ye marsiya<br>
Zulm o sitam se qatl hai jisko kiya gaya<br>
Jaari raha hai chaar baras tak ye silsilaa<br>
Zainulleba ke laal ko maara hai beqata</p>

<p>Haalat ye kya hai deen ke qidmat guzaari ki<br>
Misle Hussain dee'n pe jaa'n apni nisaar ki</p>

<p>Parchaar jisne deen e quda ka sada kiya<br>
Ummat ne usko haye ye kaisa sila diyaa<br>
Koofe me us ghareeb ko zaqmi kiya gaya<br>
Jaa'n deke deen e Mustafa ko hai bacha liya</p>

<p>
Zaqmi to pehle teer se abd e quda hua<br>
Marne ke baad zulm hai us par siwa huwa</p>

<p>Maatam kunaa zameen thi rota tha aasmaa'n <br>
Ibn e Ali ki laash pe bhi zulm tha rawaa'n<br>
Aulaad sayyada ki hai koofe me be amaa'n<br>
Aasaar gham ke zaid ke laashe se the ayaa'n</p>

<p>Sooli pe sar buland tha laasha shaheed ka<br>
Udh udh ke qaak padhti thi nouha shaheed ka</p>

<p>Us par bhi gham na kam hua zaid e shaheed ka<br>
Sooli se tan utaara tha zaid e shaheed ka<br>
Aur phir jasad jala diya zaid e shaheed ka<br>
Koi nashaa'n naa reh saka zaid e shaheed ka</p>

<p>Baqi dilou me aaj hai ulfat ghareeb ki<br>
Jannat nashaan aaj hai turbat ghareeb ki</p>

<p>Loota hai aaj mout ne aale nabi ka ghar<br>
Maatam kiya imaam ne ibne imaam par<br>
Zer e alam hai fatima zehra bhi nouha gar<br>
Dunya se uth gaya wo jo tha deen ka sipar</p>

<p>Phir se mila hai aaj naya gham batool ko<br>
Dete hai aaj bete ka pursa rasool ko</p>